==Trivia==
*The top of the Surge Base resembles the [[wikipedia:Monument to the Revolution of the people of Moslavina|Monument to the Revolution of the people of Moslavina]] in Croatia.
**The soul that appears when the [[Surge Attack#Counter-Surge|Counter-Surge]] ability activates has a similar shape.
*A bug involving how [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|Animated Bases]] spawn in if they're not counted as boss enemies, discovered in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]], made it possible for the Surge Base to attack the Cat Base on [[Ohno Road]].

